text = "
Froggy has to defend himself with the big \"thing\" he found
Survive as long as you can and smash as many bugs as possible.

CONTROLS
WASD ........ Move
Mouse ....... Aim your weapon
Left Click .. Swing (it launches bugs away)
Space ....... Dash toward the cursor

TIPS
- Stay on the lilypads. Water slows you down and hurts you.
- Dashing flies you over water, but the landing is up to you.
- Swinging jolts your cursor, so aim your next dash carefully!
- Chain kills quickly to build a combo and score more.

Press any key to start"
scroll_active = false
horizontal_alignment = 1

